Copyright (C) 2026 Carles Llavata and OpenManager contributors, GPL-3.0-or-later, and rewritten for
OpenScene's code:

- a render preset leaves the scripts of Render Setup as they were (maxlink.load_preset);
- the question about scripts and presets answers No to Enter (dialogs.ask_safely);
- a variant decides whether its layers are on (maxlink.actions);
- a class found by an older name (oscn_classNamed);
- Batch Render never renders without saving: names cleaned for Windows, what a path lacks, the check
  before the batch and the written file looked for after each render (model.build_path,
  model.batch_check, model.find_written);
- the maps found in one walk and kept in a cache (oscn_allMaps, oscn_mapsNamed);
- lasting IDs of the nodes and layers setups use (oscn_stampNodes, oscn_resolveNodes,
  model.apply_resolved and the functions around it).
